---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Contact – Online Copy Paste"
  description="Contact the Online Copy Paste team for support, privacy questions, abuse reports, or service feedback."
>
  <main class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 py-12 md:py-16">
    <a href="/" class="text-sm font-semibold text-amber-700 hover:text-amber-800 dark:text-amber-300 dark:hover:text-amber-200">&larr; Back to Online Copy Paste</a>
    <section class="mt-8 rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-100 via-white to-amber-50 dark:from-[#111318] dark:via-[#07090d] dark:to-[#17120b] p-8 md:p-12">
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Contact Online Copy Paste</h1>
      <p class="mt-5 text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">Need help with a text transfer, want to report a problem, or have a question about how your information is handled? Email us and include the details that will help us understand the request.</p>
      <a href="mailto:contact@onlinecopypaste.com" class="mt-8 inline-flex items-center rounded-xl bg-amber-500 px-6 py-3 font-semibold text-slate-950 transition-colors hover:bg-amber-600">contact@onlinecopypaste.com</a>
    </section>

    <section class="mt-12 prose prose-slate dark:prose-invert prose-lg">
      <h2>What to Include</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>For a technical problem: what you tried, which device or browser you used, and the exact error message.</li>
        <li>For a transfer issue: the approximate time and whether the code was expired or already retrieved. Do not send the text itself if it contains sensitive information.</li>
        <li>For privacy requests: describe the request clearly so we can identify the relevant processing.</li>
        <li>For abuse reports: provide the relevant transfer code or URL only if it is safe and lawful to share.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>We do not ask you to email passwords, payment details, private keys, or other secrets. Online Copy Paste transfers are temporary, so contact us promptly if your request concerns a specific transfer.</p>
      <h2>Related Information</h2>
      <p>Read our <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a> to understand temporary text storage and our <a href="/terms">Terms of Service</a> for acceptable use and service limitations.</p>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>
